        <note>This stemma is limited to the Renaissance family alpha of witnesses. The article introduces a newly discovered Renaissance manuscript of Petronius' Satyricon, Indiana, Notre Dame 58 (I). The article includes a detailed stemma codicum illustrating the relationships among the Renaissance subgroup α. The shelfmarks are not given here (nor in Reynolds) and should be checked in K. Müller, ed. 1961. Petronii Arbitri Satyricon cum apparatu critico. Munich: Heimeran.</note>
